              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Speed of the bicycle Time taken 3.6 km = 15 min 3 6 1000. km× m km = 15 60min× s min 3.6 × 1000 m = 15 × 60 s = 4 m/s Activity 8.4: Let us calculate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
